WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.684
Model card 1: how many faces does a cube have? Let us think carefully. A cube has 6

00:00:05.684 --> 00:00:07.816
faces. The answer is 6. Great work!

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:14.173
Model card 2: how many faces does a cuboid have? Let us think carefully. A cuboid has

00:00:14.173 --> 00:00:16.787
6 faces. The answer is 6. Great work!

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.876
Model card 3: how many faces does a square pyramid have? Let us think carefully. A

00:00:22.876 --> 00:00:26.491
square pyramid has 5 faces. The answer is 5. Great work!

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:32.443
Model card 4: how many flat circular faces does a cylinder have? Let us think

00:00:32.443 --> 00:00:37.180
carefully. A cylinder has 2 flat circular faces. The answer is 2. Great work!
